{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "elfishawy-cafe-api-production",
    "name": "الفيشاوي - Elfishawy Cafe API Production",
    "description": "# 📌 Elfishawy Cafe POS & Management API\n\nBy: Sayed Herzallah\n\n## 🔹 Overview\n\nA robust, high-performance RESTful API built for managing **Elfishawy Cafe**. Developed with Node.js, Express, and Mongoose, this API powers the Point of Sale (POS) system, catalog management, inventory levels tracking, cafe expense auditing, table reservations, and real-time dashboard analytics.\n\nThe project strictly adheres to professional standards including structured input validation, secure cryptographic handling of sensitive customer information, and strict business rule verification on transactions.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- 🔐 **Dynamic JWT Authentication**  \n    Role-based authentication securing routes using unique keys derived from the user's creation timestamps. Automatic token expiration invalidates old keys upon password modification.\n    \n- 👥 **Staff Management (RBAC)**  \n    Administrative user management for registering, listing, and terminating staff accounts with explicit role allocations (`admin`, `manager`, `cashier`).\n    \n- 📁 **Catalog CRUD (Categories & Products)**  \n    Manage coffee varieties, desserts, cold juices, and shisha catalog items. Features integrated image upload utilizing Cloudinary storage buffers.\n    \n- 🛍️ **POS Sales & Orders**  \n    Safe checkout processing. The backend recalculates totals and validates unit pricing directly from the database to prevent pricing manipulations. It automatically decrements inventory stock quantities.\n    \n- 📦 **Inventory Management**  \n    Tracks raw ingredients (e.g. coffee beans, milk, sugar) with minimum limit threshold warnings for low-stock alerting.\n    \n- 💸 **Expense Logs & Auto-Restock**  \n    Tracks operational costs (rent, utilities, salaries). Logging an `inventory` category expense automatically increments target raw material quantities in the inventory system.\n    \n- 🪑 **Table Reservations**  \n    Booking validation system that intercepts table double-bookings by checking time conflicts within a ±2-hour window of the requested schedule. Encrypts customer details at rest using AES-256.\n    \n- 📊 **Dashboard & Charts Analytics**  \n    Consolidated statistics (KPI stats) and deep aggregate pipelines providing 30-day sales trends, category expense breakdowns, and top-selling menu items.\n\n---\n\n## 🌐 Base URL\n\n```\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 Authentication\n\nAll protected routes require a valid JWT token in the request header:\n\n```\nAuthorization: <accessToken>\n```\n\nTokens are issued upon login and saved automatically inside the environment variable `{{token}}`.\n\n---\n\n## 👥 User Roles & Permissions\n\n| Role | Permissions |\n| --- | --- |\n| `admin` | Full control over staff management, catalog, order refunds, expenses, inventory, and analytics. |\n| `manager` | Managed operations: create products/categories, restock inventory, audit expenses, view reservations, and track sales trends. Cannot delete staff or admins. |\n| `cashier` | Sales access: process orders, view catalog items, and manage table reservations. Cannot view inventory levels, expenses, or analytics. |\n| `Public` | Can create table reservations (`POST /reservations`). |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "# 🔐 Authentication & Session Tokens\n\nHandles staff authentication and access token renewals. Login credentials return standard JWT tokens.\n\n---\n\n### 🔑 Login\n`POST /auth/login`  \nAuthenticates staff and returns access & refresh tokens.\n\n📥 **Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"admin@elfishawy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@12345\"\n}\n```",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Login success status', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "if (res.tokens?.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", res.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", res.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Access and Refresh tokens stored in environment\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@elfishawy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", res.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ New accessToken set in environment\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refreshToken",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refreshToken"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
